      "widgets_values": [
        "## Flux.2 Klein Switchable Single Image Edit + Main-Canvas LoRA\n\nUse the preset loader to switch between Flux.2 Klein 9B Base and Flux.2 Klein 4B Distilled. The node loads the matching diffusion model, text encoder, and VAE.\n\nOverride fields are editable: leave them empty to use the selected preset, or enter exact filenames to experiment with another diffusion model, text encoder, or VAE.\n\nThe Multi LoRA Stack stays on the main canvas so LoRA rows are easy to edit. Enter the image edit instruction and optional negative prompt on the subgraph node."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
